    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>z</mi></math> be positive real numbers such that <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.1</mo></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>600</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> is equal to",
